---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>펭귄 책방 — 동네책방·북카페</title>
  <meta name="description" content="서울 연남동의 작은 동네책방이자 북카페. 매달 엄선한 책 큐레이션과 한 잔의 커피." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Mukta:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --orange: #ff6f00;
      --orange-deep: #e85d00;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --paper: #faf6ee;
      --ink: #161310;
      --ink-soft: #3a352f;
      --rule: #161310;
      --band: clamp(72px, 12vw, 132px);
      --font: 'Hanken Grotesk', 'Mukta', 'Gill Sans', 'Gill Sans MT', Calibri, sans-serif;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font);
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.55;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, h4 {
      font-family: var(--font);
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      line-height: 1.04;
    }

    .wrap { width: min(1120px, 92vw); margin: 0 auto; }

    /* ============ PENGUIN LOGO ============ */
    .penguin-mark { display: block; }
    .penguin-mark .body { fill: var(--ink); }
    .penguin-mark .belly { fill: var(--white); }
    .penguin-mark .beak { fill: var(--orange); }
    .penguin-mark .ring { fill: none; stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 4; }

    /* ============ TRIBAND CORE ============ */
    .triband {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: var(--band) auto var(--band);
      border: 3px solid var(--ink);
      background: var(--white);
    }
    .triband > .top, .triband > .bottom { background: var(--orange); }
    .triband > .center {
      background: var(--white);
      border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);
      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);
    }

    /* ============ HERO ============ */
    .hero { padding: 88px 0 64px; }
    .cover {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: var(--band) auto var(--band);
      border: 4px solid var(--ink);
      background: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 14px 14px 0 rgba(22,19,16,0.16);
      min-height: 560px;
    }
    .cover .band-top, .cover .band-bottom {
      background: var(--orange);
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 clamp(20px, 4vw, 44px);
    }
    .cover .band-top {
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .cover .band-bottom {
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .cover .center {
      background: var(--white);
      border-top: 4px solid var(--ink);
      border-bottom: 4px solid var(--ink);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: clamp(36px, 7vw, 72px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 56px);
      gap: 26px;
    }
    .cover .logo-circle {
      width: clamp(84px, 12vw, 116px);
      height: clamp(84px, 12vw, 116px);
    }
    .cover .series {
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.32em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--orange-deep);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .cover h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 8vw, 5.4rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .cover .sub {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.3rem);
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-weight: 500;
      max-width: 30ch;
    }
    .cover .author {
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
      padding-top: 18px;
    }

    /* ============ SECTION SHELL ============ */
    section { padding: clamp(56px, 9vw, 96px) 0; }
    .sec-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);
      padding-bottom: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .sec-num {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--orange);
      border: 2px solid var(--ink);
      padding: 4px 12px;
    }
    .sec-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4.4vw, 2.7rem);
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .sec-head .tail {
      margin-left: auto;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* ============ BOOK GRID ============ */
    .book-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
    }
    .book {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: 56px auto 56px;
      border: 3px solid var(--ink);
      background: var(--white);
      transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease;
    }
    .book:hover {
      transform: translate(-4px, -4px);
      box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--orange);
    }
    .book .b-top, .book .b-bottom {
      background: var(--orange);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 16px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .book .b-bottom { justify-content: space-between; }
    .book .b-center {
      border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);
      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);
      padding: 28px 20px 30px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      min-height: 220px;
    }
    .book .cat {
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--orange-deep);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .book h3 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .book .by {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .book .blurb {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      margin-top: auto;
    }
    .book .price { font-weight: 800; }

    /* ============ CAFE ============ */
    .cafe {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 0;
      border: 3px solid var(--ink);
      background: var(--white);
    }
    .cafe .lead {
      padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px);
      border-right: 3px solid var(--ink);
    }
    .cafe .lead p {
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-top: 18px;
      max-width: 44ch;
    }
    .cafe .lead .hours {
      margin-top: 32px;
      border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
      padding-top: 20px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .cafe .lead .hours span { color: var(--orange-deep); font-weight: 800; }
    .menu { display: grid; }
    .menu-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 18px clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 34px);
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    }
    .menu-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .menu-row .dot {
      flex: 1;
      border-bottom: 2px dotted rgba(22,19,16,0.35);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    .menu-row .name { font-weight: 700; }
    .menu-row .won { font-weight: 800; color: var(--orange-deep); }

    /* ============ CLUBS ============ */
    .clubs {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .club {
      border: 3px solid var(--ink);
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: 44px auto;
    }
    .club .strip {
      background: var(--orange);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 16px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);
    }
    .club .body { padding: 26px 22px 28px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .club h3 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; }
    .club .meta {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-weight: 600;
      display: grid;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .club .meta b { color: var(--ink); }
    .club p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

    /* ============ CONTACT ============ */
    .contact-cover {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: var(--band) auto var(--band);
      border: 4px solid var(--ink);
      background: var(--white);
    }
    .contact-cover .band-top, .contact-cover .band-bottom { background: var(--orange); }
    .contact-cover .band-top {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink);
    }
    .contact-cover .band-bottom {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink);
    }
    .contact-cover .center {
      border-top: 4px solid var(--ink);
      border-bottom: 4px solid var(--ink);
      padding: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px) clamp(24px, 5vw, 56px);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .contact-cover .info h3 {
      font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--orange-deep); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .contact-cover .info p { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .contact-cover .info p.big { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.6vw, 2rem); font-weight: 800; }
    .contact-cover .info span { color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 500; display: block; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 4px; }

    /* ============ FOOTER ============ */
    footer {
      border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);
      padding: 36px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    footer .penguin-mark { margin: 0 auto 14px; }
    footer p { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 600; }
    footer .copy { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }

    /* ============ RESPONSIVE ============ */
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .book-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .clubs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cafe { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cafe .lead { border-right: none; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); }
      .contact-cover .center { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .book-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .sec-head .tail { display: none; }
      .cover { min-height: 480px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
    <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
    <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 16 · 펭귄 책방 — 1960년대 펭귄 페이퍼백 스타일</span>
    <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
  </div>
  <div style="height:40px;"></div>

  <!-- ============ HERO / 표지 ============ -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cover">
        <div class="band-top">
          <span>Penguin Books · 연남</span>
          <span>No. 016</span>
        </div>
        <div class="center">
          <svg class="logo-circle penguin-mark" viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-label="펭귄 책방 로고">
            <circle class="ring" cx="60" cy="60" r="56" />
            <ellipse class="body" cx="60" cy="64" rx="30" ry="40" />
            <ellipse class="belly" cx="60" cy="70" rx="17" ry="30" />
            <circle class="belly" cx="50" cy="44" r="4" />
            <circle class="belly" cx="70" cy="44" r="4" />
            <circle class="body" cx="50" cy="44" r="1.8" />
            <circle class="body" cx="70" cy="44" r="1.8" />
            <polygon class="beak" points="60,50 54,57 66,57" />
            <polygon class="beak" points="48,100 60,94 60,104" />
            <polygon class="beak" points="72,100 60,94 60,104" />
          </svg>
          <div class="series">동네책방 · 북카페</div>
          <h1>펭귄 책방</h1>
          <p class="sub">읽고 싶은 책이 먼저 말을 거는 곳. 연남동 골목의 작은 서가와 한 잔의 커피.</p>
          <div class="author">SINCE 2018 · SEOUL YEONNAM</div>
        </div>
        <div class="band-bottom">
          <span>큐레이션 · 커피 · 모임</span>
          <span>매일 11:00 — 22:00</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ============ 01 이달의 책 ============ -->
  <section id="books">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="sec-num">01</span>
        <h2>이달의 책</h2>
        <span class="tail">JUNE CURATION</span>
      </div>
      <div class="book-grid">
        <article class="book">
          <div class="b-top">Fiction · 소설</div>
          <div class="b-center">
            <span class="cat">이달의 추천</span>
            <h3>여름의 끝에서</h3>
            <p class="by">한정원 지음 · 연두출판</p>
            <p class="blurb">계절이 바뀌는 골목에서 만난 사람들의 조용한 이야기.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="b-bottom"><span>국내소설</span><span class="price">15,800원</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="book">
          <div class="b-top">Essay · 산문</div>
          <div class="b-center">
            <span class="cat">책방지기의 선택</span>
            <h3>천천히, 읽는 밤</h3>
            <p class="by">서지우 지음 · 밤독서</p>
            <p class="blurb">느리게 읽는 즐거움을 되찾는 24개의 독서 에세이.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="b-bottom"><span>에세이</span><span class="price">14,200원</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="book">
          <div class="b-top">Poetry · 시</div>
          <div class="b-center">
            <span class="cat">시집 코너</span>
            <h3>골목의 빛</h3>
            <p class="by">문도윤 지음 · 작은시집</p>
            <p class="blurb">연남동을 닮은 짧고 환한 마흔 편의 시.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="b-bottom"><span>시집</span><span class="price">12,000원</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="book">
          <div class="b-top">Nonfiction · 인문</div>
          <div class="b-center">
            <span class="cat">함께 읽기</span>
            <h3>도시를 걷는 법</h3>
            <p class="by">강민서 지음 · 길과집</p>
            <p class="blurb">걷기와 도시, 그리고 일상을 다시 보는 인문 탐사.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="b-bottom"><span>인문</span><span class="price">17,500원</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="book">
          <div class="b-top">Picture · 그림책</div>
          <div class="b-center">
            <span class="cat">어린이·어른 모두</span>
            <h3>작은 펭귄의 여행</h3>
            <p class="by">이로아 글·그림 · 종이배</p>
            <p class="blurb">남극을 떠나 도시에 닿은 펭귄의 다정한 모험담.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="b-bottom"><span>그림책</span><span class="price">16,000원</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="book">
          <div class="b-top">Reprint · 고전</div>
          <div class="b-center">
            <span class="cat">다시 읽는 고전</span>
            <h3>오래된 정원</h3>
            <p class="by">박은하 옮김 · 펭귄클래식</p>
            <p class="blurb">한 세기를 건너온 문장, 새 번역으로 만나는 명작.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="b-bottom"><span>고전</span><span class="price">13,500원</span></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 02 북카페 ============ -->
  <section id="cafe">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="sec-num">02</span>
        <h2>북카페 안내</h2>
        <span class="tail">COFFEE & READING</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cafe">
        <div class="lead">
          <h3 style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;">책장 사이의 한 잔</h3>
          <p>책방 한쪽엔 여섯 개의 테이블이 있습니다. 산 책은 그 자리에서 펼쳐 읽어도 좋고, 음료 한 잔이면 두 시간이 짧습니다. 작은 공간이라 조용한 대화를 부탁드립니다.</p>
          <div class="hours">
            <div><span>영업</span> 매일 11:00 — 22:00 (라스트오더 21:30)</div>
            <div><span>휴무</span> 매월 첫째 주 월요일</div>
            <div><span>좌석</span> 6테이블 · 노트북석 2</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="menu">
          <div class="menu-row"><span class="name">핸드드립 커피</span><span class="dot"></span><span class="won">6,000</span></div>
          <div class="menu-row"><span class="name">플랫 화이트</span><span class="dot"></span><span class="won">5,500</span></div>
          <div class="menu-row"><span class="name">계절 차 (홍차·캐모마일)</span><span class="dot"></span><span class="won">5,000</span></div>
          <div class="menu-row"><span class="name">펭귄 라떼 (시그니처)</span><span class="dot"></span><span class="won">6,500</span></div>
          <div class="menu-row"><span class="name">레몬 사블레 (수제)</span><span class="dot"></span><span class="won">3,500</span></div>
          <div class="menu-row"><span class="name">책 + 음료 세트 할인</span><span class="dot"></span><span class="won">-1,000</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 03 독서모임 ============ -->
  <section id="clubs">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="sec-num">03</span>
        <h2>독서 모임</h2>
        <span class="tail">READING CLUBS</span>
      </div>
      <div class="clubs">
        <div class="club">
          <div class="strip">월요일 밤</div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3>천천히 읽기</h3>
            <div class="meta">
              <span><b>일정</b> 매주 월 20:00 — 22:00</span>
              <span><b>정원</b> 8명 · 회비 월 30,000원</span>
            </div>
            <p>한 권을 4주에 걸쳐 깊이 읽는 정독 모임. 소설과 에세이 위주.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="club">
          <div class="strip">목요일 저녁</div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3>시 읽는 목요일</h3>
            <div class="meta">
              <span><b>일정</b> 격주 목 19:30 — 21:00</span>
              <span><b>정원</b> 6명 · 회비 월 24,000원</span>
            </div>
